          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_sub_l_one_pseudo_norms_approximate_w",
          "text": "Sub-l-one pseudo-norms approximate it well but are non-convex, so most methods retreat to the convex l-one norm, which over-shrinks, especially when variables outnumber samples.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
