          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_bayesian_graphical_lasso_gives_full",
          "text": "The Bayesian Graphical Lasso gives a full posterior and a marginal likelihood, but relies on Gibbs samplers that mix poorly and must restart for every lambda.",
